   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2021-10-21",
   "text": "Prohibiting IRS Financial Surveillance Act \n This bill prohibits the Department of the Treasury from requiring a financial institution to report the balances, transactions, or the transfers into and out of a financial account. This prohibition does not apply to laws or regulations in effect on the date of enactment."
  }
